OL,3,GNEWSAAuthors warn libraries proposals
OL,4,Acould 'pave the way' for censorship
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Communities'
OL,7,Fconsultation, which will help shape
OL,8,Flibrary services over the next decade,
OL,9,Fcloses at 23:59 GMT on Wednesday.
